  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/423496062335189014/1114855644680437840/stoneborn_text.png\" alt=\"石裔標誌，下方附有梅伊的擴充內容\" width=\"1241\" height=\"375\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><em><span style=\"font-size:24px\">《石裔 - 梅伊的擴充內容》是為<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stoneborn-dwarven-fantasy-inspired-ui-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">《石裔 - 矮人奇幻風格介面全面翻新》</a>（由Sindavar33製作）與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stoneborn-modded-compatibility-sbmc\" rel=\"nofollow\">《石裔 - 模組兼容介面 - SBMC》</a>（由Fr_z_n製作）所開發的擴充套件，旨在為更多模組提供兼容支援！</span></em></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><em><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/339/line.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1500\" height=\"100\"></span></em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><em><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">原版《石裔》資源包由Sindavar33製作</span></strong></span></span></em></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><em><span style=\"font-size:24px\">《石裔 - 梅伊的擴充內容》在開發時已同時考量原版《石裔》資源包與Fr_z_n的擴充內容。因此，為獲得最佳體驗，兩者皆需安裝。本資源包不會覆蓋Fr_z_n資源包中相同的介面（除極少數特殊情況外），而是與其協同運作</span></em></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><em><span style=\"font-size:24px\">建議載入順序如下：</span></em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><em><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 《石裔 - 矮人奇幻風格介面全面翻新》</span></em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><em><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 《石裔 - 梅伊的擴充內容》</span></em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><em><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 《石裔 - 模組兼容介面 - SBMC》</span></em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stoneborn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/459/226/637734804507733830.png\" alt=\"《石裔》主頁面\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\"></em></span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><em><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">-</span></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stoneborn-modded-compatibility-sbmc\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/727/403/638080725702354339.png\" alt=\"Fr_z_n製作的《石裔》模組介面擴充\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\"></a></span></em></span><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stoneborn-modded-compatibility-sbmc\" rel=\"nofollow\">-</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/339/line.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1500\" height=\"100\"></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">截至v1.0版本，已支援以下模組（部分為有限支援，因Fr_z_n的資源包已涵蓋部分內容！）：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">（請注意，本人僅透過Forge環境測試，無法保證於Fabric版本模組的兼容性）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apotheosis\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apotheosis</a><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architects-palette\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architect's Palette</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armor-statues\" rel=\"nofollow\">Armor Statues</a></span></p><p