elight</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/framedblocks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Framed Blocks</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/frosted-friends\" rel=\"nofollow\">Frosted Friends</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/frozen-up\" rel=\"nofollow\">Frozen Up</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-quests-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Quests</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/human-companions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Human Companions</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/item-filters\" rel=\"nofollow\">Item Filters</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jobsplus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jobs+</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/libipn\" rel=\"nofollow\">libIPN</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/little-logistics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Little Logistics</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/manyideas-core\" rel=\"nofollow\">ManyIdeas Core</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecolonies\" rel=\"nofollow\">MineColonies</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-bath\" rel=\"nofollow\">MOA Decor Bath</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-cookery\" rel=\"nofollow\">MOA Decor Cookery</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-monsters\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mutant Monsters</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/new-mutant-more\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mutant More</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nether's Delight</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phantasmic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nourished Nether / Phantasmic</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obscure-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Obscure API</a></span></p><p><span style<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-profiles-next\" rel=\"nofollow\">InventoryProfilesNext</a>（部分支援其新版村民交易書籤功能，需在Fr_z_n資源包之上安裝）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;<strong><br></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">1.2版新增：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zenith\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Zenith</a><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-engine\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spell Engine</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">1.3版新增：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alcocraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alcocraft+</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomancy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomancy</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/do-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do API</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/domum-ornamentum\" rel=\"nofollow\">Domum Ornamentum</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enlightend\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enlightend</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extradelight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extra Delight</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Aircraft</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lets-do-bakery\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do Bakery</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/beachparty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do Beachparty</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lets-do-candlelight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do Candlelight</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/welcome-to-meadow\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let's do Meadow</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/malum\" rel=\"nofollow\">Malum</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythic-mounts-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mythic Mounts</a>（Forge版，但Fabric版應有相同介面！）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/red-power\" rel=\"nofollow\">Red Power</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/travelers-backpack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traveler's Backpack</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/proficiency-honest-work\" rel=\"nofollow\">Proficiency: Honest Work (Levels)</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\">已知問題：</span></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:14px\">目前無！<br></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/339/line.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1500\" height=\"100\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">本資源包與Fr_z_n的資源包應能完整涵蓋《中世紀Minecraft》[FORGE] 1.19.2版（MMC3）的所有介面，並支援其他模組。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">特別感謝Luna Pixel Studios的chorb鼓勵我將此資源包發布於CurseForge！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">歡迎試用他們的資源包！：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/medieval-mc-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/489/55/medievallogo.png\" alt=\"中世紀Minecraft標誌\" width=\"1920\" height=\"596\"></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/medieval-mc-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\">&nbsp;-</span></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/339/line.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1500\" height=\"100\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">本專案經Sindavar33授權發布：</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/423496062335189014/1114892971633033246/Discord_QyaoeLmWnM.png\" alt=\"Sindavar授權託管此衍生專案\" width=\"1589\" height=\"746\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">若喜歡我的作品，歡迎<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmeixdev\" rel=\"nofollow\">請我喝杯檸檬汁/贊助Ko-fi</a>！</span></p>\n\n（注：已保留所有HTML標籤與超連結結構，僅對可讀性文字進行正體中文轉換，並針對模組名稱保留原文約定俗成的呈現方式。特殊